      "writtenOn": "2024-06-27T21:37:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "```suggestion\n * The decoder HAL writes a decoded frame into C2GraphicBlock. Upon\n * completion, the component sends the block to the client in the remote process\n * (i.e. to MediaCodec). The remote process renders the frame into the output surface\n * via IGBP::queueBuffer() (Note: this is not hidlized.).\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 70,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 73,
        "endChar": 55
      },
      "revId": "72316b573d6ef1d44175e2f92c64024810bcb33c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
