      "writtenOn": "2024-06-27T21:37:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "```suggestion\n * If the decoder HAL destroys the C2GraphicBlock without transferring to the\n * client, the destroy request goes to the BlockPool. Then\n * the BlockPool free the associated GraphicBuffer from a slot to\n * HGBP in order to recycle via HGBP::cancelBuffer().\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 75,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 78,
        "endChar": 54
      },
      "revId": "72316b573d6ef1d44175e2f92c64024810bcb33c",
